1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,700
Thank you all for coming to my talk this evening.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:06,540
It's nice to see so many people in the audience.

3
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:11,517
For those of you who don't know very much about PS Camping, let me

4
00:00:11,517 --> 00:00:15,110
start by giving you some background information about the company.

5
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:18,800
The company started twenty-five years ago.

6
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,950
It actually opened as a retail chain selling camping equipment,

7
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:27,843
and then twenty years ago, it bought a small number of campsites in the

8
00:00:27,843 --> 00:00:28,384
UK,

9
00:00:28,384 --> 00:00:30,750
and began offering camping holidays.

10
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:36,662
The company grew rapidly and has been providing holidays in continental Europe for the

11
00:00:36,662 --> 00:00:38,130
last fifteen years.

12
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:43,341
If you book a camping holiday with us, you'll have a choice of over

13
00:00:43,341 --> 00:00:44,750
three hundred sites.

14
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:50,111
In Italy we now have some 64 sites that we either own,

15
00:00:50,111 --> 00:00:52,320
or have exclusive use of.

16
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:55,978
France is where we have the majority of sites,

17
00:00:55,978 --> 00:01:00,260
and we currently have a project to expand into Switzerland.

18
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:06,129
We also have a number of sites in Northern Spain, particularly in the mountainous

19
00:01:06,129 --> 00:01:08,240
region of Picos de Europa.

20
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:11,493
We've upgraded all these Spanish sites,

21
00:01:11,493 --> 00:01:15,670
and improved them considerably from their original three-star rating.

22
00:01:15,670 --> 00:01:20,820
We believe our holidays offer superb facilities for the whole family.

23
00:01:20,820 --> 00:01:25,475
Parents who want their children to be fully occupied for all

24
00:01:25,475 --> 00:01:30,050
or part of the day can take advantage of our children's activities.

25
00:01:30,050 --> 00:01:35,120
These are organised by our well-qualified and enthusiastic staff:

26
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:39,857
Each day kicks off with a sports match, perhaps football,

27
00:01:39,857 --> 00:01:43,650
or volleyball, followed by an hour of drama for everyone.

28
00:01:43,650 --> 00:01:48,600
This may include singing or dancing, mime or other activities.

29
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:56,465
In the afternoon, there's a different art activity for each day of the week including a poster competition

30
00:01:56,465 --> 00:01:57,950
or model making.

31
00:01:57,950 --> 00:02:02,649
What's more, our sites are truly child-friendly,

32
00:02:02,649 --> 00:02:07,850
and, with this in mind, we operate a no-noise rule in the evenings.

33
00:02:07,850 --> 00:02:13,783
Children's evening activities usually finish at 9.30,

34
00:02:13,783 --> 00:02:15,728
or occasionally 10,

35
00:02:15,728 --> 00:02:21,200
and from 10.30 holiday-makers are expected to be quiet in the areas where there

36
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:21,250
are tents.

37
00:02:21,250 --> 00:02:26,221
We want nothing to go wrong on a PS Camping holiday,

38
00:02:26,221 --> 00:02:30,940
but if it does, we also want all customers to be insured.

39
00:02:30,940 --> 00:02:36,117
If you haven't organised an annual insurance policy of your own you'll need to

40
00:02:36,117 --> 00:02:40,753
take out the low-cost cover we offer and we require that you arrange this

41
00:02:40,753 --> 00:02:42,800
when you make your holiday reservation.

42
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:46,605
There are many advantages to choosing PS Camping,

43
00:02:46,605 --> 00:02:48,900
and to recommending it to others.

44
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:53,231
As a regular customer, you'll be kept informed of special offers,

45
00:02:53,231 --> 00:02:56,860
and your friends can benefit from ten per cent off their holiday,

46
00:02:56,860 --> 00:03:00,910
or book a luxury tent for the price of a standard one.

47
00:03:00,910 --> 00:03:04,104
In return, we'll send you a thank-you present,

48
00:03:04,104 --> 00:03:07,840
which you can choose from a list of high-quality items.

49
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:14,040
When it comes to our tents, these are equipped to the highest standard.

50
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:18,915
We really do think of every essential detail, from an oven

51
00:03:18,915 --> 00:03:23,490
and cooking rings fuelled by bottled gas, to mirrors in the bedroom areas.

52
00:03:23,490 --> 00:03:29,325
If you don't want to cook indoors, you can borrow a barbecue if you

53
00:03:29,325 --> 00:03:31,630
ask in advance for one to be made available,

54
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:35,560
and there's even a picnic blanket to sit on outside your tent.

55
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:39,682
Inside, a box of games and toys can be found,

56
00:03:39,682 --> 00:03:43,000
and children's tents can be hired if required.

57
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,448
All tents have a fridge,

58
00:03:45,448 --> 00:03:49,661
and if you want to spend the day on the beach, for example, ask

59
00:03:49,661 --> 00:03:52,791
for a specially designed PS Camping cool box,

60
00:03:52,791 --> 00:03:55,480
which will keep your food and drinks chilled.

61
00:03:55,480 --> 00:04:00,873
There are excellent washing facilities at all our sites, with washing machines

62
00:04:00,873 --> 00:04:04,702
and clothes lines in the central areas, along with mops

63
00:04:04,702 --> 00:04:08,070
and buckets in case your tent needs cleaning during your stay.

64
00:04:08,070 --> 00:04:14,425
All sites have a cafe and/or a shop for those who'd rather 'eat in'

65
00:04:14,425 --> 00:04:15,410
than dine at a local restaurant.
